# Delivery Report

Complete this report only with evidence produced by the implemented Skill and its evaluations.

<!-- scaffold-contract:delivery-report:v1 -->
```json
{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "requirements": [],
  "capability_claims": []
}
```

Each passing requirement uses exactly `id`, `implementation`, `verification`, and `status`. Each blocked requirement adds exactly the non-empty `blocker` and `unblock_condition` fields.
